{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blackout is a hardcore co-op shooter in which you destroy the mechanical zombies that have infested the Earth Federation. From a secret laboratory no one knows to a high-speed subway station that exists deep underground, Players become near-future special forces and dispatch them to major facilities throughout the federation to wipe out every horde of mechanical zombies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2415000/extras/ezgif-1406d1759326de.gif?t=1749631604\" /></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">corpses combined with machines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All zombies in Blackout are combined with different machines. Zombies with grotesque abilities to match their form will always find you and cut you to pieces. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">4-player cooperative action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All fields and levels are played alone, and if it is difficult to fight zombies, Squad up with up to 4 other players to crush zombies Blackout is best experienced cooperatively with other players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Various maps and strategies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Blackout, players face a variety of fields. Therefore, players equip the firearms of their choice and You have to choose and focus on which strategy to carry out the mission. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2415000?t=1749631604","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2415000?t=1749631604","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2415000/1cacc43ae8e95648daed8f2fc41bf2aaead44c78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749631604","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2415000/1cacc43